Workflow Labeling Strategy for Kubernetes Resources

Status: Accepted

Context: 
- Project Workflows must incorporate a Kubernetes labeling
  strategy to support observability and Orchestrator reconstruction.

Decision:
- All Kubernetes resources created and managed by the Orchestrator must implement this label:
  - app.kubernetes.io/managed-by=sovereign-orchestrator

- Namespaces will have the following labels:
  - sovereign-orchestrator/workflow-id=<ID of the workflow>

- Pods created within a workflow will have the following labels:
  - sovereign-orchestrator/step-name=<Step name>
  - sovereign-orchestrator/requires-review=<true || false>
